WEBVTT

00:12:58.076 --> 00:13:01.076
What matters here is that we relearn

00:13:01.116 --> 00:13:04.196
how to have these
face-to-face discussions,

00:13:04.236 --> 00:13:06.436
without anyone else listening,

00:13:06.436 --> 00:13:07.716
with a stranger.

00:13:07.756 --> 00:13:10.396
Not only with a stranger
we are introduced to

00:13:10.436 --> 00:13:12.676
by a Tinder for politics,

00:13:12.716 --> 00:13:17.436
but also with a stranger in a pub
or in a gym or at a conference.

00:13:18.236 --> 00:13:20.276
So please meet someone

00:13:20.276 --> 00:13:21.796
and have an argument

00:13:21.836 --> 00:13:23.716
and enjoy it very much.

00:13:23.756 --> 00:13:24.996
Thank you.

00:13:25.036 --> 00:13:28.836
(Applause)

00:13:28.876 --> 00:13:30.036
Wow!